{
  "info": {
    "name": "MoonTech API",
    "description": "Complete API documentation for the MoonTech e-commerce backend.\n\n## Authentication\n- Register with name, phone (Egyptian format `01xxxxxxxxx`), and password.\n- Verify phone via OTP sent on registration.\n- Login returns a Bearer token stored as `{{token}}`.\n- Protected endpoints require `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\n\n## Roles\n- **user** — create orders, view own orders, subscribe to back-in-stock, manage notifications.\n- **admin** — manage products (`/api/admin/products`), list all orders (`/api/admin/orders`), update order statuses.\n\n## Transitions (Order Status)\n- `pending` → `confirmed`, `cancelled`\n- `confirmed` → `processing`, `cancelled`\n- `processing` → `shipped`, `cancelled`\n- `shipped` → `delivered`\n- `delivered`, `cancelled` → (terminal — no further changes)\n\n## Environment Variables\n| Variable | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `{{base_url}}` | API base URL (e.g. `http://localhost:8080/api`) |\n| `{{token}}` | Bearer token from login/register |\n| `{{product_id}}` | Product ID from create/list responses |\n| `{{order_id}}` | Order ID from create/list responses |\n| `{{notification_id}}` | Notification ID from list response |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "product_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "order_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "notification_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Endpoints for registration, phone verification, login/logout, password reset, and fetching the authenticated user.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Ahmed Ali\",\n    \"phone\": \"01012345678\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user. Phone must match the Egyptian pattern `01xxxxxxxxx`. An OTP is sent via notification for phone verification."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (201)",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"User registered successfully\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"user\": {\n            \"id\": 1,\n            \"name\": \"Ahmed Ali\",\n            \"phone\": \"01012345678\",\n            \"role\": \"user\",\n            \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n        },\n        \"token\": \"1|abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789abcdef\"\n    }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Validation Error (422)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"The phone field format is invalid. (and 1 more error)\",\n    \"errors\": {\n        \"phone\": [\n            \"The phone field format is invalid.\"\n        ],\n        \"password\": [\n            \"The password field confirmation does not match.\"\n        ]\n    }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Duplicate Phone (422)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"The phone has already been taken.\",\n    \"errors\": {\n        \"phone\": [\n            \"The phone has already been taken.\"\n        ]\n    }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"phone\": \"01012345678\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Login with phone and password. Returns a Bearer token (store as `{{token}}`)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Login successful\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"user\": {\n            \"id\": 1,\n            \"name\": \"Ahmed Ali\",\n            \"phone\": \"01012345678\",\n            \"role\": \"user\",\n            \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n        },\n        \"token\": \"1|abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789abcdef\"\n    }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Invalid Credentials (401)",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Invalid credentials\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Authenticated User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/user",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["user"]
            },
            "description": "Fetch the currently authenticated user's profile."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"data\": {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"name\": \"Ahmed Ali\",\n        \"phone\": \"01012345678\",\n        \"role\": \"user\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n    }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Unauthenticated (401)",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Unauthenticated.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revoke the current access token."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Logged out successfully\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Phone",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/phone/verify",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["phone", "verify"]
            },
            "description": "Verify the phone number with the OTP received during registration."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Phone number verified successfully.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Invalid OTP (422)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Invalid OTP.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Expired OTP (410)",
              "status": "Gone",
              "code": 410,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"OTP has expired. Request a new one.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Already Verified (422)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Phone number is already verified.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend Phone OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"phone\": \"01012345678\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/phone/resend",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["phone", "resend"]
            },
            "description": "Resend the phone verification OTP. Rate-limited to 1 request per minute."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"A new OTP has been sent to your phone.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Account Not Found (404)",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"No account found with this phone number.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"phone\": \"01012345678\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["forgot-password"]
            },
            "description": "Request a password reset OTP. Rate-limited to 1 request per minute."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"OTP sent to your phone.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Account Not Found (404)",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"No account found with this phone number.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"phone\": \"01012345678\",\n    \"otp\": \"654321\",\n    \"password\": \"newpassword456\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"newpassword456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["reset-password"]
            },
            "description": "Reset the password using the OTP received via forgot-password. All existing tokens are revoked on success."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Password reset successfully.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Invalid OTP (422)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Invalid OTP.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Expired OTP (410)",
              "status": "Gone",
              "code": 410,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"OTP has expired. Request a new one.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Products (Admin)",
      "description": "Admin CRUD for products. All endpoints require `auth:sanctum` + `role:admin`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/products?page=1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Paginated list of all products (20 per page)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"current_page\": 1,\n    \"data\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": 1,\n            \"title\": \"Wireless Bluetooth Headphones\",\n            \"description\": \"High-quality wireless headphones with noise cancellation.\",\n            \"price\": \"1499.99\",\n            \"stock\": 50,\n            \"image\": \"http://localhost:8080/storage/products/abc123-headphones.jpg\",\n            \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:05:00.000000Z\",\n            \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:05:00.000000Z\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"id\": 2,\n            \"title\": \"Mechanical Gaming Keyboard\",\n            \"description\": \"RGB mechanical keyboard with Cherry MX Blue switches.\",\n            \"price\": \"2499.99\",\n            \"stock\": 30,\n            \"image\": \"http://localhost:8080/storage/products/def456-keyboard.jpg\",\n            \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:06:00.000000Z\",\n            \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:06:00.000000Z\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"from\": 1,\n    \"to\": 2,\n    \"total\": 2,\n    \"per_page\": 20,\n    \"last_page\": 1\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Forbidden (403)",
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Forbidden.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "title", "value": "Wireless Bluetooth Headphones", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "High-quality wireless headphones with noise cancellation, 30-hour battery life, and comfortable over-ear design.", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "price", "value": "1499.99", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "stock", "value": "50", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "image", "type": "file", "src": "" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/products",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "products"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new product. Image is optional (max 2 MB, types: jpeg/png/jpg/gif/webp)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (201)",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Product created successfully\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"title\": \"Wireless Bluetooth Headphones\",\n        \"description\": \"High-quality wireless headphones with noise cancellation, 30-hour battery life, and comfortable over-ear design.\",\n        \"price\": \"1499.99\",\n        \"stock\": 50,\n        \"image\": \"http://localhost:8080/storage/products/abc123-headphones.jpg\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:05:00.000000Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:05:00.000000Z\"\n    }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Validation Error (422)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"The title field is required. (and 2 more errors)\",\n    \"errors\": {\n        \"title\": [\"The title field is required.\"],\n        \"price\": [\"The price field is required.\"],\n        \"stock\": [\"The stock field is required.\"]\n    }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "products", "{{product_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Show a single product by ID."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"data\": {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"title\": \"Wireless Bluetooth Headphones\",\n        \"description\": \"High-quality wireless headphones with noise cancellation, 30-hour battery life, and comfortable over-ear design.\",\n        \"price\": \"1499.99\",\n        \"stock\": 50,\n        \"image\": \"http://localhost:8080/storage/products/abc123-headphones.jpg\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:05:00.000000Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:05:00.000000Z\"\n    }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Not Found (404)",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Resource not found\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "title", "value": "Wireless Bluetooth Headphones Pro", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "price", "value": "1799.99", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "stock", "value": "75", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "products", "{{product_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update a product. Only send the fields you want to change (partial updates are supported)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Product updated successfully\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"title\": \"Wireless Bluetooth Headphones Pro\",\n        \"description\": \"High-quality wireless headphones with noise cancellation, 30-hour battery life, and comfortable over-ear design.\",\n        \"price\": \"1799.99\",\n        \"stock\": 75,\n        \"image\": \"http://localhost:8080/storage/products/abc123-headphones.jpg\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:05:00.000000Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-30T10:08:00.000000Z\"\n    }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Validation Error (422)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"The price must be at least 0.\",\n    \"errors\": {\n        \"price\": [\"The price must be at least 0.\"]\n    }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "products", "{{product_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Delete a product. The associated image file is also removed from storage."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Product deleted successfully\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Stock Subscription",
      "description": "Allow authenticated users to subscribe for back-in-stock notifications on out-of-stock products.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Subscribe (Notify Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products/{{product_id}}/notify-me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{product_id}}", "notify-me"]
            },
            "description": "Subscribe the authenticated user to be notified when a product is back in stock. Rejected with 422 if the product is currently in stock. Idempotent — subscribing twice returns a success message without creating a duplicate."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Subscribed (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"You will be notified when this product is back in stock.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Already Subscribed (200)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"You are already subscribed to this product.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Product In Stock (422)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n    \"message\": \"Product is already in stock.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders (User)",
      "description": "Endpoints for authenticated users to create and view their own orders.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List My Orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
